 :why-this-repository
 "kotoba-lang lang/q9-migration.edn :current-decision names
  :requalify-wave-1-pilots-as-whole-component-builds as the next action, and as
  of 2026-09-10 exactly two of the twenty pilots had a whole-component build:
  com-aadhaar and com-aave. Two is a pattern only if the third one reproduces
  it, so this is the third.

  The oracles are the same generated actor template. Measured by diffing
  src/aave/main.cljc against src/abb_robotics/main.cljc with the repository
  name normalised away: they differ in the docstring and the entity-specs
  table, and in nothing else."

