  :main {:value 30
         :meaning "route-count: five routes per entity over six entities, computed from the entity table rather than written down."}
  :oracle-expand
  {:values {0 253212778 1 23955074 2 458522191 3 23955074 4 728485347 5 23955074}
   :reading
   "Three selectors collapse to one value, 23955074, and that is the point:
    selector 1 asks for a field that is not a ref, 3 asks against an entity
    whose refs are empty, and 5 is the record with no expansion at all. All
    three must be the unexpanded record and all three are.

    Against that floor, selector 0 (one ref) and selector 4 (BOTH refs) are
    different values, and different from each other. The two-ref fold folds
    twice. Selector 2 points at a Part the store does not hold and lands on the
    null arm, distinct again.

    A run that only reported selector 4 would not be able to tell a working
    fold from a fold over nothing."}
