 :blocked-layers
 {:float-coercion
  {:status :blocked
   :reached true
   :detail
   "Robot declares `:coerce {:payloadKg :float}`, so this component REACHES the
    arm com-aadhaar also reaches. `coerce-field`'s float branch preserves the
